The total senior credit facility in 2010 was $1.4 billion, consisting of a $420.5 million term loan and a $945.5 million revolving credit facility. 

Therefore, the revolving credit facility represented $945.5 million / $1.4 billion = 0.675 or 67.5% of the total senior credit facility. 


\boxed{67.5\%}
